{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "woman-in-the-dunes",
  "chunk_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-chunk-0656",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00656",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "男人也一直蹲坐在门槛上。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The man, too, remained squatting on the threshold.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00656",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "挤出唾液，又咽下去。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He squeezed out saliva, then swallowed it down again.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00656",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "如此来回几次，唾液变得跟浆糊一样黏稠，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "After doing this back and forth several times, his saliva grew as thick and sticky as paste,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00656",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "丝丝拉拉缠绕在喉咙口。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "clinging in stringy strands at the opening of his throat.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00656",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "虽然没感觉到睡意，但因疲劳，意识成了濡湿的纸。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Though he did not feel sleepy, fatigue had turned his consciousness into wet paper.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00656",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "透过纸张去看，风景成了混浊的斑纹和线条，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Seen through that paper, the landscape became murky blotches and lines,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00656",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "浮了起来。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "floating up before him.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00656",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "简直像“画谜语”似的风景。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It was a landscape almost like a picture riddle.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00656",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "有女人……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "There was the woman...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00656",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "有沙子……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "There was sand...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00656",
      "unit_index": 11,
      "source_text": "有空荡荡的水缸……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "There was an empty water jar...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00656",
      "unit_index": 12,
      "source_text": "有滴着口水的狼……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "There was a drooling wolf...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00656",
      "unit_index": 13,
      "source_text": "有太阳。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "There was the sun.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00656",
      "unit_index": 14,
      "source_text": "……然后，在他不知道的什么地方，若是有热带性低气压，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "...And then, somewhere unknown to him, if there was a tropical low-pressure system,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00656",
      "unit_index": 15,
      "source_text": "就一定有不连续的线条。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "there must surely be broken lines.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00656",
      "unit_index": 16,
      "source_text": "然而，这个净是未知数的方程式该从何处入手好呢？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "But where should he begin with this equation made up entirely of unknowns?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
